        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DJO-20-FE, Security Door Edge Reinforcer Plates</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity door reinforcer plate for use with <b>1-3/4\" thick doors</b>. Can be used with metal, composite or wood doors. Packaged with installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-20-fe_size.gif?v=1704354661\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 20-FE Security Reinforcer Plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-inch-thick-door-reinforcer-plate-djo-10-fe\"><b>1-3/8\" Thick Door Edge Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your doors from entry tools and tampering with this wrap around security door edge plate. Designed to protect and wrap around a  deadbolt latch or door knob/lever latch with a standard 1\" door edge bore hole.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DJO-20-FE Security Reinforcer Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Security Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Plate Thickness: 22 Gauge (.032\")</l>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>#8 x 3/4\" Phillips Truss Head Trim screws in matching finish</li>\r\n<li>#8-32 x 1/4\" Flat Head latch mounting screws in matching finish</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/20-FE.pdf?v=1704262279\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 20-FE Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
