                "title": "Security Door Reinforcer Plate, DJO-20-FE",
                "description": "DJO-20-FE Security Door Reinforcer Plate. For use with 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Can be used with metal, composite or wood doors. Packaged with installation screws. Protect your doors from entry tools and tampering with this wrap around security door edge plate. Designed to protect and wrap around a  deadbolt latch or door knob/lever latch with a standard 1 inch door edge bore hole.",
